  "description": "Centralized container logs for the Zero-Trust stack (Person 6). These are the raw logs every component already prints, read from Loki: the long tail, the unstructured lines, and the operational failures the audit trail deliberately ignores. The decisions themselves (permits, denials, trace joins) are in the audit dashboard at http://localhost:8088/dashboard.",
